    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Signed Condition Sign‑off:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">After the visual and mileage checks are completed, the recipient signs a condition report that references the pickup photos, the verified odometer, and any noted discrepancies. The signer acknowledges receipt of the vehicle in the documented state, and a copy of the signed form is retained by both parties for future reference.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<p>The final step is to file the signed report, the updated odometer log, and the photographic comparison in the shipment’s electronic file. This comprehensive record minimizes disputes, speeds up claim resolution if needed, and provides clear evidence that the two‑wheeler arrived exactly as agreed.</p></div>
